                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "4 months ago",
                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "I absolutely loved this place! The Chili con Carne Omelette was incredibly delicious, the omelette was so fluffy, and when combined with the rich Pork meat sauces, it became really special and full of flavor. You can tell a lot of care went into making it. I also really enjoyed the bagel, it was fresh and paired perfectly with the meal. The fries were perfectly golden and crispy, and honestly hard to stop eating.\nDefinitely a spot I’d come back to again!",
                                     "languageCode":  "en"
                                 },
